`~` keeps ordinary growth from making this file wrong. Re-measure them only","-when one is off by enough to change a decision. Counts last checked 2026-09-05.","+when one is off by enough to change a decision. Counts last checked 2026-10-02."," "," Memory files named in these indexes (`project_*.md`, `user_*.md`) live in the"," workspace's Tier A folder: Mac `~/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/`,"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/STATUS.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":17,"lines":[" # STATUS — ~/DEV workspace root"," "," ## Current state","+- 2026-10-02 (Windows, doctor-plus): `claude doctor` clean (2.1.288). Fixed 4 shift flags, all pushed:","+  SessionStart now points to the daily log instead of pasting its 30-line tail (claude-memory-compiler","+  `09c6264`); dead `localhost:31337` voice gate removed from Science/ArXiv/ISA and 6 skill descriptions","+  trimmed under 650 chars (skills `86209b9`); claude.ai-synced duplicates of closeout/dev-sync/","+  five-slides-generator/new-project hidden via `anthropic-skills:*` \"off\" in skillOverrides (dotclaude","+  `87763b3`, verified by headless control); global MEMORY env note → pointer; router counts re-measured.","+  Open: `outputStyle: \"ELI5\"` has no style file on Windows (no-op here; check Mac `~/.claude/output-styles/`);","+  `impeccable` description left long (vendored). Later same day: `articulation-skill` back in canonical","+  as a tracked real folder with a Do-not clause (skills `2ca8fbd`); synced copy hidden (dotclaude `751bbdd`);","+  checker 44/44. **Mac NEXT:** `rm ~/.claude/skills/articulation-skill` (old untracked entry), then","+  `git -C ~/.claude/skills pull`, or the pull refuses to overwrite it."," - 2026-10-02 (Windows, decision audit): 11 avoided decisions decided and recorded across 13 repos","   (TypeSafe maintenance, OKRs_2026-27 closed, S2 parked, Flint tensions resolved, repo archive batch,","   CATES 2025 canonical). Process is now the `decision-audit` skill. NEXT: Eric posts R5 #001 v4;"]},{"oldStart":94,"oldLines":6,"newStart":105,"newLines":9,"lines":[" - Baylor's 2026 forecast snapshot is frozen at 4.49 expected wins."," "," ## Next","+- Mac: `rm -rf ~/.claude/skills/articulation-skill` then `git -C ~/.claude/skills pull`","+  (re-tracked 10/2; the old untracked copy blocks the pull). Then check for","+  `~/.claude/output-styles/ELI5.md`. Detail: `docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-doctor-plus.md`."," - Codex: after a fresh session, check whether SessionEnd completes without a","   timeout and inspect the remaining warning screens. Reduce duplicate plugin","   skill bundles only after choosing which ones should stay available; the"]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-doctor-plus.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":45,"lines":["+# Handoff 2026-10-02 — doctor-plus (Windows)","+","+## What and why","+Ran `/doctor-plus`: `claude doctor` (clean, 2.1.288) plus an audit of always-loaded","+context against the six context-engineering shifts. Eric approved every fix, \"local","+copies win over synced ones\".","+","+## Decisions (with reasoning)","+- **Daily log is a pointer, not a pasted tail.** The 30-line tail landed mid-section","+  in every session, often action items from an unrelated session that read like","+  instructions. Same treatment the knowledge index got on 8/29.","+- **claude.ai-synced duplicates are hidden, not deleted.** `skills/synced/` re-syncs from","+  the claude.ai account on every start, so deleting the folder does not stick. Deleting","+  on claude.ai would break claude.ai chat (the synced five-slides-generator is written","+  for the claude.ai sandbox). `\"anthropic-skills:<name>\": \"off\"` in `skillOverrides`","+  works — verified with a headless on/off control run.","+- **articulation-skill is canonical again.** It was removed from git 9/10 (665e558) and","+  left as untracked per-machine copies (Windows: a symlink into `~/.agents/skills`).","+  First fix (retire it, 724aeca) was wrong because the Mac copy is live; superseded by","+  re-tracking it as a real folder and hiding the synced copy.","+- **Voice-notification gate removed** from Science/ArXiv/ISA: nothing listens on","+  `localhost:31337`, and the block was a MANDATORY step before any work.","+","+## Files changed (all pushed)","+- `~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler/hooks/session-start.py` — `09c6264`","+- `~/.claude/skills/{Science,ArXiv,ISA,research-in-5,decision-audit,interview-me,brain-audit}/SKILL.md` — `86209b9`","+- `~/.claude/skills/articulation-skill/` (SKILL.md, references/examples.md) — `2ca8fbd`","+- `~/.claude/settings.json` (skillOverrides: 5 `anthropic-skills:*` off; local articulation-skill \"off\" removed) — `87763b3`, `724aeca`, `751bbdd`","+- `~/.claude/projects/C--Users-eric-rash-Desktop-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md` — `1a0e486`, `576ed1b`","+- `~/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md` (Win env note → pointer to machine.md) — `eb458d6`","+- `~/Desktop/DEV/CLAUDE.md` (counts re-measured), `docs/STATUS.md`, this file","+","+## Next","+1. Mac: `rm -rf ~/.claude/skills/articulation-skill` (plain `rm` if a symlink), then","+   `git -C ~/.claude/skills pull`. If the Mac copy has edits Windows lacks, back it up first.","+2. Mac: check whether `~/.claude/output-styles/ELI5.md` exists. `\"outputStyle\": \"ELI5\"`","+   has no style file on Windows, so it is a no-op here.","+3. Next session start: confirm the listing shows no `anthropic-skills:` copies of","+   closeout, dev-sync, five-slides-generator, new-project, articulation-skill.","+","+## Open","+- `impeccable` description is 895 chars (over the ~650 budget); left alone because it is","+  vendored and an update would overwrite an edit.","+- `.errors.log` not cleared: perch-pull (Mac), daily-backup, and a memsearch gRPC blip","+  at 21:16Z during a Milvus restart (healthy again)."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/CLAUDE.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/STATUS.md","/Users/kristinarash/DEV/docs/handoffs/2026-10-02-doctor-plus.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3ba41d3f-f270-4c4e-af35-b51f6a6b87d0","session_id":"0949803b-b5a4-4eec-8bc8-87b3ccc4c359","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","sessionKind":"bg"}
