{"parentUuid":"4b5d08fa-eee5-4b2a-bc1e-f124b95077f2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffT27hPs5uLtbKAK5P8U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync is done, and everything is clean on the Mac.\n\n**Sync**\n- Root: `/Users/kristinarash/DEV`.\n- Config, skills and memory are pulled and pushed. Skills are synced to Codex.\n- Memory brought in 4 commits from Windows. The newest is \"handoff: perch-pull confirmed complete\".\n- Both machines had written to the same log file, `transcripts/2026-10-02.md`. I kept both versions.\n- Memory mirror: 15 projects paired, nothing copied.\n- 150 folders checked. 15 repos got new commits from GitHub. `CommandCentre` had one changed log file (`server.out`), so I saved it and pushed it.\n- Nothing was cloned or created, and no `.from-*` files were made.\n- GitHub shows two repos that are not in DEV. Both are fine:\n  - `claude-global-memory` is in `~/.claude`.\n  - `Linda_Projects` is the `Linda Projects` folder.\n\n**Picking up: Flint.** It has the most recent work among your active repos.\n- **Last session:** 2026-10-03, about 8:40 AM, on Windows. These commits came in from GitHub.\n- **Where things stand:** All 73 OneDrive folders are marked keep. \"The System\" is checked, and it is already in the queue as W62. \"Black Book\" is in the queue as X5, Enhanced Edition. 42Analytics is in the vault and its review is closed (151 entries).\n- **Blocked on:** The next Jev pass can only run on Windows, because the file catalog is only there. You also still owe three things: the Jev blind audit, the answers to the CLA primer questions, and listening to the CVASPS audio.\n- **Next:**\n  1. On Windows, run `uv run scripts/triage_model_pass.py`, then `uv run scripts/jev_pass.py state`, then `uv run scripts/jev_pass.py run`.\n  2. On either machine, keep ingesting books in queue order. The current queue comes first, then Wave 1, then Wave 2.\n\nWhat do you want to work on?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":516,"cache_read_input_tokens":92506,"output_tokens":750,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":56},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":516,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":92506,"cache_creation_input_tokens":516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":516},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CffT27RHVc9j7Qpg1hmcG","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"c8a9954f-d240-4800-8431-19113671105a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:19:19.243Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"0949803b-b5a4-4eec-8bc8-87b3ccc4c359","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","sessionKind":"bg"}
