{"parentUuid":"658ac4dc-3029-49e4-b77e-aa99fcf8f4b7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffVDas5KsToZ4yDSRgz6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fixer agent is working now.\n\n**Review results**\n- 15 entries passed.\n- 8 entries need fixes. The biggest one: an entry about power gets the physics wrong but is rated \"proven\". Power at each moment is always force times speed. The real mistake is multiplying an average force by an average speed.\n- The other 7 fixes are small:\n  - Some lines need an \"Inference:\" label.\n  - One wrong reading of the source needs a fix.\n  - One table number (2.7) looks like a misprint and must be marked unclear.\n  - One map row in `_book.md` needs updating.\n\n**What happens next**\n1. The fixer checks each fix against the book pages, then applies it. If the reviewer is wrong, the fixer writes down why.\n2. A different reviewer then checks the fixed entries (round 2).\n3. Then I stop and ask you before anything goes into the vault.\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2069,"cache_read_input_tokens":146369,"output_tokens":298,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2069,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":146369,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2069,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2069},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffVDaS2QSSd5ZWDP3jkV","type":"assistant","uuid":"b935dc47-ce70-483f-b793-670