h parachute entries.\n\n**Manual edits (these replace existing text, so they can't be script rows):**\n1. In the ten-dimension specificity entry, \"(this book's Ch4.3, not yet ingested)\" becomes \"(this book's Ch4.3, [[framework--five-criteria-of-dynamic-correspondence]])\".\n2. and 3. In the isokinetic and choice-of-regime entries, \"(see 4.3)\" becomes \"(see 4.3, [[framework--five-criteria-of-dynamic-correspondence]])\".\n4. In the Evans wrestling case study, the whole placeholder Related paragraph is replaced with links to the five-criteria and boxer/shot-putter entries. This one had to be manual: the file ends with a stray `&lt;/content&gt;` line right after Related, so the script's append would have landed after it and left the placeholder in place. The edit also deletes that line.\n\nEach \"Old\" string was checked to occur exactly once in its file.\n\n**Doubts:**\n- **Moyer → parachute sizing is the weakest link.** The sizing entry never mentions wearable resistance. I kept the Related text to what both files support: both describe resistance applied at sprint speed that grows with running speed. Drop that row if you want only direct ties; the parachute-tradeoffs row is the strong one, since that entry names limb-worn weights itself.\n- **Petrakos link format.** Its two existing links are wrapped in backticks, which stops them working as links in Obsidian. I used plain links instead, the same format the Dupuy brief got in the 2026-09-28 batch.\n- **Staging copies will go stale.** 15 of the 16 sources have staging copies identical to the vault today. The script and the manual edits change only the vault, so a later promotion of those book folders would overwrite the new links. Refresh staging from the vault first; the header flags this.\n- **Running it on the Mac.** The script's VAULT is a Windows path, so run a temp copy with VAULT changed rather than the script itself. I left the repo script unedited.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>145489</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>23</tool_uses><duration_ms>319943</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"5040dbd5-ea4f-408f-8849-af910131fdd0","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:38:30.248Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":3,"turnIndex":8},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
