{"parentUuid":"d962bef4-f63d-4642-b372-dd1e5ddd5e91","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffZ8cDGaLK3fNmGQYVcS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X9bgB3Bxxz55x4FESvhZHK","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n","new_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## 2026-10-03 (Mac): *Supertraining* 4.3-4.4 promoted, Chapter 4 complete\n- **Source on the Mac:** the book is now staged at `staging/books/supertraining-6th-expanded.pdf` (copied from Drive `09_PRO_DEV/TB's Training Info (snapshot 2026-09-26)/Verkhoshansky/`, md5 `d3453c5e...` matches `_book.md`). Other staged books and OCR still exist only on Windows.\n- **Gate:** Opus atomizer wrote 23 entries (4.3: 13, 4.4: 10). Round 1 (`staging/review_supertraining_ch4-3-4_opus.md`): GO AFTER FIXES, 15 GO / 8 FIX / 0 NO-GO; worst miss was the power entry rating a wrong physics claim `proven`. Fixes applied and logged (`staging/fixes_supertraining_ch4-3-4_applied.md`); power entry renamed `claim--average-or-peak-force-times-velocity-is-not-power`. Round 2 (`staging/review_supertraining_ch4-3-4_opus_round2.md`): PROMOTE, 23 GO. Codex not used (independent fresh Opus reviewers).\n- **Promoted on Eric's approval:** SecondBrain `8d0909e` (23 entries + `_book.md`, Chapter 4 row now done, 64), then `104eb0e` (15 reciprocal links from `staging/reciprocal_links_2026-10-03.md` plus 4 manual edits, incl. the Evans wrestling placeholder Related and stray `</content>` line). Staging synced back, dry run 0 drift. memsearch index of the library started 2026-10-03.\n- **Mac tooling gap:** `promote_to_vault.py`, `apply_reciprocal_links.py`, `sync_back_from_vault.py` and `lint_library.py` hard-code the Windows vault path. This session ran Mac-path copies from `staging/_tmp/` (gitignored); the repo scripts are unchanged. Fix: read the vault path from `~/.claude/skills/_shared/config.<platform>.json`.\n- **Source oddities recorded in entries, not resolved:** Table 4.2 Class 1 factor IV 2.7 (likely a misprint), the \"6% ... only 7%\" sentence (PDF 261), Pattengale & Holloszy 1967 is a treadmill study the book cites for strength training.\n- **Next for this book:** Chapter 5, The Methods of Special Strength Training, printed 255-312 / PDF idx 266-323 (58 pages, split into batches).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1839,"cache_read_input_tokens":182665,"output_tokens":1184,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1839,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1184,"cache_read_input_tokens":182665,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1839},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01X9bgB3Bxxz55x4FESvhZHK":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n","new_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## 2026-10-03 (Mac): *Supertraining* 4.3-4.4 promoted, Chapter 4 complete\n- **Source on the Mac:** the book is now staged at `staging/books/supertraining-6th-expanded.pdf` (copied from Drive `09_PRO_DEV/TB's Training Info (snapshot 2026-09-26)/Verkhoshansky/`, md5 `d3453c5e...` matches `_book.md`). Other staged books and OCR still exist only on Windows.\n- **Gate:** Opus atomizer wrote 23 entries (4.3: 13, 4.4: 10). Round 1 (`staging/review_supertraining_ch4-3-4_opus.md`): GO AFTER FIXES, 15 GO / 8 FIX / 0 NO-GO; worst miss was the power entry rating a wrong physics claim `proven`. Fixes applied and logged (`staging/fixes_supertraining_ch4-3-4_applied.md`); power entry renamed `claim--average-or-peak-force-times-velocity-is-not-power`. Round 2 (`staging/review_supertraining_ch4-3-4_opus_round2.md`): PROMOTE, 23 GO. Codex not used (independent fresh Opus reviewers).\n- **Promoted on Eric's approval:** SecondBrain `8d0909e` (23 entries + `_book.md`, Chapter 4 row now done, 64), then `104eb0e` (15 reciprocal links from `staging/reciprocal_links_2026-10-03.md` plus 4 manual edits, incl. the Evans wrestling placeholder Related and stray `</content>` line). Staging synced back, dry run 0 drift. memsearch index of the library started 2026-10-03.\n- **Mac tooling gap:** `promote_to_vault.py`, `apply_reciprocal_links.py`, `sync_back_from_vault.py` and `lint_library.py` hard-code the Windows vault path. This session ran Mac-path copies from `staging/_tmp/` (gitignored); the repo scripts are unchanged. Fix: read the vault path from `~/.claude/skills/_shared/config.<platform>.json`.\n- **Source oddities recorded in entries, not resolved:** Table 4.2 Class 1 factor IV 2.7 (likely a misprint), the \"6% ... only 7%\" sentence (PDF 261), Pattengale & Holloszy 1967 is a treadmill study the book cites for strength training.\n- **Next for this book:** Chapter 5, The Methods of Special Strength Training, printed 255-312 / PDF idx 266-323 (58 pages, split into batches).\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffZ8bkjDck76F59aWRZ3","type":"assistant","uuid":"c7d968ed-481c-4a76-9a60-14236eacfd89","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:39:30.581Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","vers