{"parentUuid":"aed886bc-db7b-494d-bea8-0c207dda4030","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffauQUCPfWefpNCa3FQD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Part 5a is written: 19 new entries, and the lint check passes. Its first review is running now. Parts 5b and 5c are still being written.\n\n**What the 5a writer did**\n- It read every table and number from the page pictures, not from the error-filled text layer.\n- It recorded the places where the book contradicts itself, with page numbers for both sides. One example: the book gives 3 different percentages for the same repetition maximum (the most weight you can lift that many times).\n- It rated one entry \"proven\", about force and momentum (Newton's second law). The new reviewer is checking that physics line by line. Last time, a physics error was the worst problem.\n\n**What happens next**\n1. Each part goes through review, then fixes, then a second review.\n2. I update the book map once, after all 3 parts are done.\n3. I ask you before anything goes into the vault.\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2263,"cache_read_input_tokens":203896,"output_tokens":326,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":44},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2263,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":326,"cache_read_input_tokens":203896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2263,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2263},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CffauPoWXosQabQEp5ZDg","type":"as