{"parentUuid":"5875b8ce-fc5b-438c-ada9-e296b5dccc10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffbPP9MNSRVxiDx7WVRu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 3 writers are done. All 3 first reviews are running now.\n\n**Part 5c**\n- It covers sections 5.3 to 5.6: sequencing, the conjugate system and circuit training. It has 26 entries, and the lint check passes.\n- 9 entries are marked \"contested\". Two of those are contested because Issurin's 2016 paper disagrees with this chapter.\n\n**A possible error already in the vault**\n- One Bompa entry says Siff and Verkhoshansky put the gains from a hard, concentrated training block at \"4 to 12 weeks after the block ends\". The 5c writer could not find that claim in *Supertraining*.\n- I asked the 5c reviewer to check it. I will not change that entry without you.\n\n**Saved:** all 75 new entries are in git, on the branch `supertraining-ch5`, and pushed. Nothing is in the vault yet.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | First review running |\n| 5b | 30 | First review running |\n| 5c | 26 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":766,"cache_read_input_tokens":218040,"output_tokens":363,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":766,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":363,"cache_read_input_tokens":218040,"cache_creation_input_tokens":766,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":766},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,