{"parentUuid":"4b71361e-3f71-474c-a829-fbd909c3c177","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffbpM5GxvgiGkFGcTMvF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 5b review is back: GO AFTER FIXES. 17 entries passed, 13 need fixes, none failed. A fixer is working on 5b now.\n\n**Numbers**\n- The reviewer checked every depth-jump number against the page pictures: drop heights, contact times, sets, reps, rest and weekly frequency. All of them are right.\n\n**What needs fixing**\n- **Not real contradictions:** two entries are marked \"contested\", but the book does not truly contradict itself there. They go back to \"supported\".\n- **Your own markers:** some lines point to your method notes, and they need to be exact.\n  - mRSI is your daily readiness marker. It is not a reactive-ability score.\n  - One entry needs your DSI note from 2026-09-29, word for word.\n- **Not a depth-jump dose:** the \"sets of 10, 1 to 15 minutes rest\" dose is for jumps on the ground, with no box.\n- **A citation date to check:** the book gives Wilson 1990 in one place and Wilson 1991 in another. The reviewer recalls the right date only from memory, so the fixer must confirm it in Zotero or PubMed before it goes into the entry.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | Fixes running |\n| 5b | 30 | Fixes running |\n| 5c | 26 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2328,"cache_read_input_tokens":225323,"output_tokens":463,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2328,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":463,"cache_read_input_tokens":225323,"cac