{"parentUuid":"e1bc90aa-b2c7-4c84-be88-fcf29ae30a5b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffcGYueb72FQeHmKrX9t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 5a fixes are done, and the 5a second review is running now.\n\n**What the fixer changed**\n- It applied every fix and checked each one against the page pictures first. It found no point where the reviewer was wrong.\n- **Physics:** the force-and-momentum entry is now exact. The \"proven\" rating covers only the basic physics rule, not the book's own loose wording.\n- **Renames:** two entries got new names. All links to them now use the new names, and no link to the old names remains anywhere.\n- **Missing points:** two points the first draft left out are now in their entries:\n  - Advanced weightlifters train mostly at 1 to 3 repetitions.\n  - The book's two main ways to build speed-strength.\n- **Lint check:** no problems.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | Second review running |\n| 5b | 30 | Fixes running |\n| 5c | 26 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1734,"cache_read_input_tokens":231486,"output_tokens":320,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1734,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":231486,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1734,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1734},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffcGY8X8wfHekrhc6hT7","type":"a