{"parentUuid":"3dd48115-e687-4d36-8c73-58df2a959f66","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffcRGiovPfo1G4YfZZNX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 5c review is back: GO AFTER FIXES. 15 entries passed, 11 need fixes, none failed. A fixer is working on 5c now.\n\n**The 5c fixes**\n- **Charts read wrong:** two charts were misread (Fig 5.12 and Fig 5.14). The fixer will read the values again from the page pictures.\n- **Contradictions:** a few \"contradictions\" are not real, so they come out. The writer also missed some real ones, so those go in.\n- **Labels:** some lines need an \"Inference:\" label.\n\n**The Bompa question is answered**\n- The mistake started in Bompa and Haff's own book. Their book says Siff and Verkhoshansky put the gains 4 to 12 weeks after the training block ends.\n- *Supertraining* says something different:\n  - Gains start 1 to 3 weeks after the block.\n  - 4 to 12 weeks is how long the gains last.\n- The Bompa entry in the vault repeats Bompa's error. I will not change it unless you say so. After 5c is done, I will give you the exact wording to approve.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | Second review running |\n| 5b | 30 | Fixes running |\n| 5c | 26 | Fixes running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2265,"cache_read_input_tokens":235808,"output_tokens":436,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2265,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":235808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2265,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2265},