nd:\n1. Every file round 1 marked FIX (13) plus the prestretch entry, in full: each problem gone, each fixer disagreement justified by the page, nothing new wrong. Every \"Eric's baseline:\" quote and its tag must match method-baseline.md exactly (lines 74, 76, 77, 105, 116, 117, 122, 186 and any other cited).\n2. The Wilson source note: the fixer cites Wilson, Elliott & Wood, Med Sci Sports Exerc 1991;23(3):364-370 from the journal abstract page. Confirm the reference exists and that the entry claims no more than the abstract supports (fetch the abstract yourself, e.g. PubMed search, or the URL https://journals.lww.com/acsm-msse/Abstract/1991/03000/The_effect_on_performance_of_imposing_a_delay.16.aspx). Any Fig 5.6 match must be labelled Inference.\n3. The three confidence changes (two contested to supported, one narrowed): justified by the pages.\n4. Spot check at least 5 of the 17 round-1 GO entries against the page images, favouring prescription numbers (drop heights, contact times, sets, reps, rest).\n5. All wikilinks in the 30 files resolve (staging or vault). Every file: six section headers, no em dashes outside headers, no wrapped links, no review-history wording.\n\nWrite `/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/staging/review_supertraining_ch5b_opus_round2.md`. Final reply: overall verdict (PROMOTE / GO AFTER FIXES with list / NO-GO), GO/FIX/NO-GO counts, which GO entries you spot-checked."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5291,"cache_read_input_tokens":243871,"output_tokens":1611,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":108},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5291,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1611,"cache_read_input_tokens":243871,"cache_creation_i