{"parentUuid":"a066ce9f-aa6e-4f31-9b15-d2ee2167acfb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffciZQ94Vj35B6eKRbQi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Part 5a is ready to promote. The 5b second review is running, and the 5c fixer is still working.\n\n**5a**\n- The second review found one wrong line: the baseball example. I checked the page and fixed it myself.\n- The reviewer's suggested text also had a \"500 g\" shot figure that is not on the page, so I left it out.\n- The lint check is clean.\n\n**5b fixes**\n- All 12 fixes are applied. Each one was checked against the page pictures first.\n- Two entries went from \"contested\" to \"supported\". The book does not really contradict itself there.\n- **Your method notes:** the mRSI line now says it is your daily readiness marker. Your 2026-09-29 DSI note is in, word for word.\n- **Wilson citation:** confirmed as 1991, from the journal's own abstract page. The book's figure has the right year, and its text has the wrong one.\n- **Zotero:** the fixer could not use Zotero. The tool gave the error \"MCP tenant gate is not configured\". It does not block this work, but your Zotero link may need a look later.\n\n**Saved:** everything so far is committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch5` branch.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | Ready to promote |\n| 5b | 30 | Second review running |\n| 5c | 26 | Fixes running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":407,"cache_read_input_tokens":251324,"output_tokens":490,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":32},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":407,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output