{"parentUuid":"991bfa54-0ed6-4341-ab5f-4d65af27e93e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"ELI5"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1320623a-5d4c-4f63-85ec-61f10367bd94","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:36:05.638Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nELI5 output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
{"parentUuid":"1320623a-5d4c-4f63-85ec-61f10367bd94","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffdTZazfJpqmtJCez67d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found Bompa and Haff's book and checked the quote myself. The 5c second review is still running.\n\n**What the book says**\n- The book is at `~/DEV/BookInbox/Periodization - Theory and Methodology of Training - 5th.pdf`.\n- The quote is real. It says Siff and Verkhoshansky \"suggested that performance gains may occur 4 to 12 weeks after the cessation of the concentrated loading phase\".\n- It is on PDF index 60 (page 61 in a PDF viewer).\n- **Correction:** the same page also says that a longer, heavier training block needs more recovery time. That idea comes from Bompa and Haff's book. The 5c fixer was wrong to say neither book contains it.\n\n**What this means for the vault fix**\n- In the Bompa entry, the \"longer block, longer delay\" line is correct and stays.\n- Only the \"4 to 12 weeks\" credit to Siff and Verkhoshansky is wrong, because *Supertraining* says something else:\n  - Gains start 1 to 3 weeks after the block.\n  - 4 to 12 weeks is how long the gains last.\n- I sent this to the 5c reviewer, so it checks the 5c entry against the real page.\n\n**Saved:** all progress is committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch5` branch.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 5a | 19 | Ready to promote |\n| 5b | 30 | Ready to promote |\n| 5c | 26 | Second review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":266852,"output_tokens":515,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":462,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":515,"cache_read_input_tokens":266852,"cache_creation_input_tokens":462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":462},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffdTZ41Z1SMGyJC8aZLQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"bdfb7af1-c1f2-4e0a-9bce-99074ee1f30b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:36:10.534Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
