{"parentUuid":"b38e9949-8f79-4d46-bb9d-dda830939c9b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffde62MxupnoVaixHxPP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 3 parts of Chapter 5 passed both reviews. Every fix is in, and the test promotion is clean. I need your OK on two things.\n\n**What is ready**\n- **75 new entries.** With these, Chapter 5 is complete:\n\n  | Part | Topic | Entries |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | 5a | Maximum strength | 19 |\n  | 5b | Depth jumps and plyometrics | 30 |\n  | 5c | Sequencing and circuits | 26 |\n\n- **Reviews:** each part went through a review, fixes, and a second review. I made the last small fixes myself and checked each one against the page.\n- **Test promotion:** 75 new files, plus the expected book-map update. No existing entry gets overwritten, and there are 0 broken links.\n- **Saved:** everything is committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch5` branch.\n\n**Decision 1: promote Chapter 5**\n- **A. Promote now** (my pick). All reviews passed, and the test run is clean.\n- **B. Hold.** You read some entries first, for example the depth-jump ones (5b).\n\n**Decision 2: fix the Bompa entry in the vault**\nThe vault entry says Siff and Verkhoshansky put gains \"4 to 12 weeks after the block ends\". That claim comes from Bompa and Haff's book, not from *Supertraining*.\n- **A. Fix it** (my pick). I would change the entry to say:\n  > Bompa and Haff cite Siff and Verkhoshansky for gains 4 to 12 weeks after the block ends. *Supertraining* itself gives 1 to 3 weeks before gains appear, and 4 to 12 weeks as how long the gains last.\n\n  The entry's \"longer block, longer delay\" line stays. It is Bompa's own rule and it is correct.\n- **B. Leave it.** The new *Supertraining* entry already explains the mix-up and links to the Bompa entry."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":281117,"output_tokens":905,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":259},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":728,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":905,"cache_read_input_tokens":281117,"cache_creation_input_tokens":728,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":728},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffde5TshyPWKatMpGM5f","type":"assistant","uuid":"007b7024-6873-431b-9749-4c6ebe1d3939","timestamp":"2026-10-03T16:38:36.515Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
