{"parentUuid":"cff0abf7-fc81-4e52-a832-edd4873e723e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfffQEPFCs8csqdf3wKzU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 5 is promoted, and the Bompa entry is fixed. Both are in the vault and pushed.\n\n**What I did**\n- **Chapter 5:** I copied the 75 new entries into the vault. The test run showed 0 broken links, and no existing entry was overwritten. Vault commit: `3109157`.\n- **Bompa entry:** the 4 to 12 week claim is now credited to Bompa and Haff, with their page number (printed page 49). The entry also says what *Supertraining* itself gives:\n  - 1 to 3 weeks before gains appear\n  - 4 to 12 weeks for how long the gains last\n\n  The \"longer block, longer delay\" rule stays, credited to Bompa and Haff. Vault commit: `75f846d`.\n\n**Still running**\n- An agent is checking about 40 suggested links from older entries to the new ones. It drops any link that the files do not support. I do not have its result yet.\n\n**After that, I will:**\n1. Do a test run of the links, then add them to the vault.\n2. Re-index search.\n3. Copy the vault back into Flint, then merge the branch.\n4. Update `docs/STATUS.md`. The next step becomes Chapter 6 (printed page 313).\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3274,"cache_read_input_tokens":286002,"output_tokens":414,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3274,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":414,"cache_read_input_tokens":286002,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3274},"type":"message"}],"speed