oading-overreaching` attributed \"gains 4 to 12 weeks after the block\" to Siff and Verkhoshansky. That is Bompa & Haff 5e's citation (printed p. 49, PDF idx 60 of `~/DEV/BookInbox/Periodization - Theory and Methodology of Training - 5th.pdf`); *Supertraining* gives a 1-3 week latency (PDF 305) and 4-12 weeks as the duration of the delayed effect (PDF 375). Entry now says so; Bompa & Haff's own \"larger/longer loading, longer delay\" rule kept.\n- **Line endings:** the link script rewrote the Issurin 2016 paper brief from CRLF to LF (only one real line added). Harmless; noted in case Windows shows it as changed.\n- **Zotero MCP failed on the Mac** (\"MCP tenant gate is not configured\"); the Wilson check used PubMed instead.\n- **Next for this book:** Chapter 6, Organisation of Training, printed 313-392 / PDF idx 324-403 (80 pages; split into 3-4 batches by section).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2195,"cache_read_input_tokens":302794,"output_tokens":1768,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2195,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1768,"cache_read_input_tokens":302794,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2195},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01JJp7uQbo6bSyEq9bcembqz":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n","new_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## 2026-10-03 (Mac, later): *Supertrainin