darchuk \"Chapter 4.3 not yet ingested\" pointer). Staging synced back for Supertraining, Evans, Issurin, Zatsiorsky, Bondarchuk: 0 drift. memsearch re-index done 2026-10-03 (789 chunks, exit 0; a depth-jump query returns the new 5b entry first)."," - **Bompa fix (Eric's call):** `periodization--bompa/principle--concentrated-loading-overreaching` attributed \"gains 4 to 12 weeks after the block\" to Siff and Verkhoshansky. That is Bompa & Haff 5e's citation (printed p. 49, PDF idx 60 of `~/DEV/BookInbox/Periodization - Theory and Methodology of Training - 5th.pdf`); *Supertraining* gives a 1-3 week latency (PDF 305) and 4-12 weeks as the duration of the delayed effect (PDF 375). Entry now says so; Bompa & Haff's own \"larger/longer loading, longer delay\" rule kept."," - **Line endings:** the link script rewrote the Issurin 2016 paper brief from CRLF to LF (only one real line added). Harmless; noted in case Windows shows it as changed."," - **Zotero MCP failed on the Mac** (\"MCP tenant gate is not configured\"); the Wilson check used PubMed instead."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"883fdfee-77f7-4375-9de8-5745dd6cb061","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
