{"parentUuid":"01370891-b8db-4d19-8460-edeab93049dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffkPbR5u4LYB2jZ5TcZ5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 6 has started: 4 writers are running at the same time, one per part. I also made a new branch for this work, `supertraining-ch6`.\n\n**How I set them up**\n- Each writer adds new entry files only. I update the book map, `_book.md`, myself afterward.\n- I gave each writer the mistakes the Chapter 5 reviewers found most often. For example: notes without an \"Inference:\" label, and \"contested\" used when there is no real contradiction.\n- **6c (training load and the delayed training effect):** I told it what the library already has. That includes the corrected Bompa entry, so it does not repeat that ground.\n- **6d (programming the year):** I told it to take extra care with the model for explosive-strength sports. That model matters most for football.\n\n**Next steps**\n1. Each part gets the same reviews as before: a first review, fixes, then a second review.\n2. Then I ask you before anything goes into the vault.\n\n| Part | Sections | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 6.1 to 6.3 | Writing |\n| 6b | 6.4 to 6.8 | Writing |\n| 6c | 6.9 to 6.11 | Writing |\n| 6d | 6.12 to 6.17 | Writing |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":329,"cache_read_input_tokens":321512,"output_tokens":419,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":329,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":419,"cache_read_input_tokens":321512,"cache_creation_input_tokens":329,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input