{"parentUuid":"f265b24e-a3ee-410d-8d86-32ee7a946bf7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffnT65KfmApvnaAJmSgQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 4 writers for Chapter 6 are done, and all 4 first reviews are running now.\n\n**Part 6d**\n- **What it covers:** sections 6.12 to 6.17, how to program the training year. It has 25 entries, and the lint check passes.\n- **The football model:** the model for explosive-strength sports is in one entry. The writer read its main chart at high resolution, and every value it took from the chart is marked \"about\".\n- **Contested:** 4 entries are marked \"contested\". Three of them are contested because Issurin's 2016 paper found too little evidence for Verkhoshansky's model of loading one quality hard at a time. The reviewer will check that the entries do not stretch that finding to cover all block training.\n- **Numbers that do not add up:** for example, two sprint splits add to 10.15 seconds, but the goal they are meant to reach is 10.0 seconds.\n\n**Saved:** all 88 Chapter 6 entries are committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch6` branch.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 28 | First review running |\n| 6b | 16 | First review running |\n| 6c | 19 | First review running |\n| 6d | 25 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2423,"cache_read_input_tokens":343146,"output_tokens":418,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2423,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":418,"cache_read_input_tokens":343146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2423,"cache_creation":{"ephemera