 significant eccentric action\" qualifier. The real mismatches with the \"70% more work\" rule are bench press (+100%), squat clean (about +88%) and the lifts that fall between.\n6. **`claim--periodisation-controversy-verkhoshansky-vs-zheljazkov`**: the British-runner decline is Verkhoshansky's own claim, not Horwill's or Tschiene's. Horwill is cited for \"slavish worship\"; Tschiene for \"periodisation unchanged since Matveyev's 1965 formalisation\" (PDF 344). Split the citations and add Tschiene's point.\n\nChecks you asked for:\n- **Tables 6.1, 6.2 and 6.5, Figs 6.1-6.7 and the Ryun figure** all match the images. Both pages printing a \"Figure 6.2\" (PDF 332 and 333) are real.\n- **Writer's flagged inconsistencies** are all really on the page and correctly described: the Zone I mismatch (\"60%-\" in the table against \"50-59%\" in the text), 75 kg = 62.5%, and the Chernyak week counts summing to 36-45.\n- **Voice in 6.3**: the third-person test holds on PDF 344-345 (\"this textbook\", \"this book\"). No Siff opinion is presented as Verkhoshansky's or the reverse.\n- **Contested entries**: both are justified, and both sides are on the cited pages. Issurin 2016, Harries, Afonso and Evans are already named; no Bompa entry in the vault takes a side, so none is missing.\n- **Baseline**: every \"Eric's baseline:\" quote is verbatim with the correct line and tag, including line 106.\n- **Wikilinks**: none are broken.\n- **Duplicates**: none against the vault, Ch1, Ch5 or Ch6b-d. The report suggests optional Related links instead: the 6.15 and 6.14.x entries, and Evans's two annual-plan entries (`bompa-annual-plan-cycle-types`, `ten-step-process-for-building-an-annual-plan`).\n\nThe report also lists ideas no entry captures, mainly the chronobiology section (PDF 346-347) and Verkhoshansky's five-year-plan argument with Zheljazkov's partial agreement.\n\nThe report is at `/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/staging/review_supertraining_ch6a_opus.md`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>219531</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>31</tool_uses><duration_ms>347214</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"9dbc1dab-1150-476b-90a4-15a2599004dc","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:35:54.863Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":9,"turnIndex":34},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
