{"parentUuid":"8bfc5997-6a91-4829-80ac-ffe907e652d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffncWJbwpbCz5AFAycDf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 6a review is back: GO AFTER FIXES. A fixer is working on 6a now.\n\n**The 6a review**\n- 22 entries passed, 6 need fixes, and none failed.\n- Every table and chart matched the page pictures. The odd spots the writer flagged are really in the book.\n- **The fixes are small:**\n  - Two page positions are slightly wrong. One example: a warning is said to be on the next page, but it is on the same page.\n  - One worked example does not follow the rule the entry says it follows.\n  - One idea is credited to Siff, but the page does not name him.\n  - In the periodisation-debate entry, one claim is credited to the wrong person. It is Verkhoshansky's claim.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 28 | Fixes running |\n| 6b | 16 | First review running |\n| 6c | 19 | First review running |\n| 6d | 25 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1943,"cache_read_input_tokens":347852,"output_tokens":323,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1943,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":347852,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1943,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1943},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffncVM3uqg69qwTDS6ZJ","type":"assistant","uuid":"76855965-c4c6-4326-89bd