{"parentUuid":"3602f1c6-f0ba-4824-a3ac-50526bb06907","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffnjLwVLX8dvuuFBARCb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 6b review is back: GO AFTER FIXES. 5 entries passed, 11 need fixes, and none failed. A fixer is working on 6b now.\n\n**The biggest 6b problems**\n- **A misread chart.** The writer said one line on a chart (Fig 6.22) was nearly straight, so it disagreed with the book's text. The reviewer looked at a bigger picture of it. The line bends, just as the text says, so there is no contradiction. I told the fixer to look at the chart itself before it changes anything.\n- **Block lengths.** The book's numbers measure different things:\n  - **How long one hard block lasts:** 3 to 4 weeks, 4 to 8 weeks, or \"up to 2 months\". These 3 numbers do conflict.\n  - **How long a training stage lasts:** 4 to 12 weeks.\n  - **How long the delayed gains last:** also 4 to 12 weeks.\n\n  The entry mixed these up. It will now sort them by what each one measures.\n- **Notes about the work process.** Two entries contain notes about \"batch 6a\". Those notes come out.\n- **Labels.** Some lines need an \"Inference:\" label.\n\n**Checks that passed**\n- Your method notes are quoted exactly, with all 19 cited lines correct.\n- The 3 management models are each credited to the right person.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 28 | Fixes running |\n| 6b | 16 | Fixes running |\n| 6c | 19 | First review running |\n| 6d | 25 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2417,"cache_read_input_tokens":351952,"output_tokens":530,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":241