{"parentUuid":"3602678f-cfff-42d1-a409-6421881662d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffnuzZh2PnEFHgqYKuph","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 6a fixes are done, and its second review is running now.\n\n**What the fixer changed in 6a**\n- **All 6 fixes are in.** Each one was checked against the page pictures, and the reviewer was right on all 6.\n- **One extra fix.** An example said British middle-distance runners won Olympic gold. The page says they did well before, but won no gold in the last 30 years.\n- **New material in the periodisation-debate entry:**\n  - Verkhoshansky's argument against five-year plans, and Zheljazkov's partial agreement.\n  - The body-clock idea, marked \"untested\", because the book gives no evidence for it.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 28 | Second review running |\n| 6b | 16 | Fixes running |\n| 6c | 19 | First review running |\n| 6d | 25 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1746,"cache_read_input_tokens":357839,"output_tokens":298,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1746,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":357839,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1746},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffnuxYtWFXn3v6r8uZ2U","type":"assistant","uuid":"a8f53732-d93f-416b-9308-77f25794c9bb","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:40:08.597Z",