ained athletes.\"),\n]\nfor f,o,n in E:\n    p=Path(f);s=p.read_text();assert s.count(o)==1,(f,o[:30]);p.write_text(s.replace(o,n));print(\"ok\",f[:40])\nEOF\ncat >> /Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/staging/fixes_supertraining_ch6c_applied.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Coordinator fixes after round 2\n\nRound 2 (`review_supertraining_ch6c_opus_round2.md`): GO AFTER FIXES, 17 GO / 2 FIX. Both applied, each checked on the page text:\n1. LDTE principle: \"which reconciles those two readings\" is now a labelled Inference.\n2. Within-session heuristic: PDF 288 now quoted in full (\"even more effectively than plyometrics alone, provided ...\"), replacing \"works best\". PDF 299 now carries the page's own explanation (novices' \"lower level of special fitness\") and the untested well-trained hypothesis, with the novice vs trained split labelled Inference. `contested` kept.\nEOF\ncd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint && ~/.local/bin/uv run python3 staging/_tmp/lint_mac.py staging/library/strength-and-conditioning/supertraining--verkhoshansky 2>&1 | grep -c \"within-session\\|long-term-delayed\"","description":"Apply 6c round-2 fixes, log, lint the two files"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_read_input_tokens":408673,"output_tokens":1301,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":103},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":408673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1229,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1229},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LzKJ