{"parentUuid":"bb078954-2450-4032-8069-7ea6e363db3b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffq5M7hHxbs4PGwK4v1L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Part 6c is now ready to promote. Its second review found 2 problems, and I fixed both. Each fix matches the page, and the lint check shows nothing wrong in either file.\n\n**The fixes**\n- **A missing label:** one sentence was the writer's own reasoning but had no label. It now starts with \"Inference:\".\n- **An overstated quote:** one entry said resistance work plus plyometrics \"works best\". The page only says it works \"even more effectively than plyometrics alone\". The entry now quotes the page in full.\n- **A missing explanation:** the same entry left out the page's reason why novices saw no effect, which is their low fitness. It also left out the page's idea that trained athletes might gain. Both are now in, and the reading of them is labelled \"Inference:\".\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | 28 | Ready to promote |\n| 6b | 16 | Ready to promote |\n| 6c | 19 | Ready to promote |\n| 6d | 25 | Second review running |\n| 7a | — | Writing |\n| 7b | — | Writing |\n\nWhen 6d is done, I will ask you once about promoting all of Chapter 6. In the same question, I will ask about the one-line Addendum fix to the vault entry.\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1541,"cache_read_input_tokens":409902,"output_tokens":456,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":32},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1541,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":456,"cache_read_input_tokens":409902,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1541},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffq5LMZQnXTzV5aqPsKA","type":"assistant","uuid":"f62cf3f3-ba2b-4345-ac46-9003465690f4","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:08:30.958Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/staging/library/strength-and-conditioning/supertraining--verkhoshansky","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
