{"parentUuid":"1d0289e9-87fd-4bd4-8f21-16e1f2aad5d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffqPxuyuwofYvZigJKX8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both Chapter 7 writers are done, and both first reviews are running.\n\n**Part 7a**\n- It covers section 7.1, bodybuilding and other strength methods, with 10 entries. The lint check is clean.\n- 7 of the 10 entries are rated \"untested\". The book lists these methods but gives no data for them. I asked the reviewer to check whether that rating is too strict.\n- 3 entries are \"contested\". For example, one page sets the lightest load for cluster sets (sets with short pauses between single reps) at the 5-rep max, and another page says 75 to 90% of the 1-rep max.\n\n**Saved:** all of this work is committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch6` branch.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a, 6b, 6c | 63 | Ready to promote |\n| 6d | 25 | Second review running |\n| 7a | 10 | First review running |\n| 7b | 14 | First review running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":462,"cache_read_input_tokens":422480,"output_tokens":331,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":462,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":422480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":462,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":462},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffqPxCaFpwkav4RQmWmx","type":"assistant","uuid":"a927d4ad-daaf-45f9