{"parentUuid":"f9843e85-b26b-4fcf-9884-27b0d9de22c6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffqsVLazaNr69mxyWy5B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 7b review is back: GO AFTER FIXES. A fixer is working on 7b now.\n\n**The 7b review**\n- 4 entries passed, 10 need fixes, and none failed.\n- **The biggest fixes:**\n  - **Siff's name:** six entries credit section 7.2 to Siff. They need to cite page 429 as well, which is where the book names him.\n  - **A misread quote:** in one PNF entry, the book's \"the latter\" means the main exercises, not the stretching.\n  - **Too strict a rating:** the Fradd study has measured data, so it may go from \"untested\" to \"supported\".\n  - **The wrong book claim:** the box-squat entry sets Frost 2010 against the wrong claim in the book.\n  - **A missed contradiction:** the book disagrees with itself about which trunk muscles do the work.\n- **Checks that passed:**\n  - The quotes from your method notes.\n  - All links.\n  - The table values.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a, 6b, 6c | 63 | Ready to promote |\n| 6d | 25 | Second review running |\n| 7a | 10 | First review running |\n| 7b | 14 | Fixes running |\n\nYou do not need to do anything now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2235,"cache_read_input_tokens":425176,"output_tokens":414,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2235,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":414,"cache_read_input_tokens":425176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2235,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2235},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":nu