{"parentUuid":"c05235df-499b-4517-9ac7-82a0fbce42da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffrBRpkL9W4JsRS22vpG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All of Chapter 6 passed both reviews, and the test promotion is clean. I need your OK on two things. Chapter 7 is still in its fixes.\n\n**What is ready: 88 new entries**\n\n| Part | Topic | Entries |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a | Periodisation | 28 |\n| 6b | Management and adaptation | 16 |\n| 6c | Training load and delayed gains | 19 |\n| 6d | Programming the year, including the football model | 25 |\n\n- **Reviews:** each part went through a first review, fixes, and a second review. I made the last small fixes myself and checked each one against the page.\n- **Test promotion:** 88 new files, plus the expected book-map update, and 0 broken links. No existing entry gets overwritten.\n- **Chapter 7 drafts stay out.** They are in the same folder, so I used a temp copy of the promote script that skips them.\n- **Saved:** everything is committed and pushed on the `supertraining-ch6` branch.\n\n**Decision 1: promote Chapter 6**\n- **A. Promote now** (my pick). All reviews passed, and the test run is clean.\n- **B. Hold.** You read some entries first, for example the football model in 6d.\n\n**Decision 2: one-line fix to a vault entry**\n- **The problem:** the Chapter 5 entry `heuristic--allow-restoration-after-a-concentrated-block-before-the-next` says \"the Addendum says\". The Addendum is Verkhoshansky's own paper, so the entry should name him.\n- **A. Fix it** (my pick). The line would say \"Verkhoshansky's Addendum paper\", in the vault and in Flint's copy.\n- **B. Leave it.** The line is unclear, but not wrong.\n\n**A rating rule I already applied (change it if you disagree):** a method the book gives with clear loads, reps and rest is rated \"supported\". A tip or anecdote is rated \"untested\". This moved 2 entries in Chapter 7a up to \"supported\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":663,"cache_read_input_tokens":445711,"output_tokens":662,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":663,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":662,"cache_read_input_tokens":445711,"cache_creation_input_tokens":663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":663},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffrBQnytfjgWmfAuGpzS","type":"assistant","uuid":"e0038f9a-cdac-4635-a6fc-5afead3bb13e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:23:01.678Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
