{"parentUuid":"6544dbbd-a5e9-48bc-9578-0123d827c731","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffre9CsGkrKjXHfuYBAU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fixes for both Chapter 7 parts are done. Both second reviews are running now, and everything is committed and pushed.\n\n**7a fixes**\n- All 7 fixes are in.\n- The fixer checked a page the reviewer missed. It shows that the Western studies the book cites disagree with each other. Some found a boost, so the entry no longer says none did.\n\n**7b fixes**\n- All 7 fixes are in.\n- The Fradd study is now rated \"supported\", but only for its measured numbers.\n- The trunk-muscle entry stays \"supported\". The two book sections do not contradict each other: the second one only adds muscles to the first.\n\n| Part | Entries | Stage |\n|---|---|---|\n| 6a to 6d | 88 | Ready, waiting for your OK |\n| 7a | 10 | Second review running |\n| 7b | 14 | Second review running |\n\n**Still waiting on you, from my last message:**\n1. **Chapter 6:** promote now (A, my pick), or hold (B).\n2. **Addendum line in the vault:** fix it to name Verkhoshansky (A, my pick), or leave it (B)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":457788,"output_tokens":370,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":457788,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":379},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":