{"parentUuid":"3fdeaed9-668d-4c68-8371-852a452ffe55","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffvMPMuSdDb2XDU5cNuK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WiyTn6h1apxS4GusBXtLGP","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n","new_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## 2026-10-03 (Mac, late): *Supertraining* Chapters 6 and 7 promoted\n- **Gate, six parallel batches** (Opus atomizer, fresh Opus round-1 reviewer, Opus fixer, fresh Opus round-2 reviewer; last small round-2 fixes applied and page-checked by the coordinator; Codex not used):\n  - 6a 6.1-6.3 (28), 6b 6.4-6.8.2 (16), 6c 6.8.3-6.11 (19), 6d 6.12-6.17 (25): 88 entries. 7a lead-in and 7.1 (10), 7b 7.2-7.6 (14): 24 entries.\n  - Records: `staging/review_supertraining_ch{6a,6b,6c,6d,7a,7b}_opus*.md`, `staging/fixes_supertraining_ch{6a,...}_applied.md`, scope files `staging/_scope_supertraining_ch6{a,b,c,d}.txt`, `_ch7{a,b}.txt`.\n  - Notable calls: Fig 6.22 graph A is a decelerating curve (writer misread it as straight); block lengths sorted by what each measures (block 3-4 vs 4-8 weeks is the real conflict); Issurin 2016 does not name \"jumping-type sports\", it counts against transferring Verkhoshansky's concentrated model to team sports and swimming; \"domain rule\" for `contested` (a library source disagrees inside the sport domain the entry claims); confidence rule from 7a on (parameterised practice `supported`, tips and anecdotes `untested`).\n- **Addendum voice:** the Addendum (9.1-9.2, PDF 514-590) is Verkhoshansky's own paper translated by Yessis (PDF 515). Attribute it to him. The Ch5 allow-restoration entry fixed on Eric's call (SecondBrain `d41a087`).\n- **Promoted on Eric's approval:** SecondBrain `2708d36` (112 entries + `_book.md` Ch6-7 rows), `e0170a8` (33 reciprocal links from `staging/reciprocal_links_2026-10-03-ch6-7.md` plus 8 manual edits, incl. stale \"6.7.1\"/\"7.1 not yet ingested\" pointers). Staging synced back (Supertraining, Evans, Issurin): 0 drift. memsearch re-index started.\n- **Open, small:** 377 links from the 112 new entries into older ones have no back-link yet (a later wave). Two Evans entries end with a stray `</content>` line. `framework--functional-vs-structural-resistance-training` says balance-board training is not addressed; 7.4 now addresses it.\n- **Mac promote trick:** when unreviewed chapters share the book folder, `staging/_tmp/promote_mac_excl7.py` shows how to exclude files listed in scope files.\n- **Next for this book:** Chapter 8, Designing Sport Specific Strength Programmes, printed 421-480 / PDF idx 432-491 (60 pages); then Chapter 9 Addendum (Verkhoshansky's own, PDF 514-590).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1061,"cache_read_input_tokens":486689,"output_tokens":1501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1501,"cache_read_input_tokens":486689,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WiyTn6h1apxS4GusBXtLGP":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint/docs/STATUS.md","old_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n","new_string":"Read this first. Update it before ending every session.\n\n## 2026-10-03 (Mac, late): *Supertraining* Chapters 6 an